---
title: Peach Cobbler
---

Beat @butter{2%stick} and @sugar{2%cup} together until lightly fluffy.

Add @milk{1/2%cup} slowly as you keep mixing.

Add @flour{2%cup} and @baking powder{4%tsp} slowly until mixture is fully incorporated.

Pour into a #baking pan and top with @peaches{1%29 oz can}. Use extra as topping after.
